      "mergeID": "66fc073cd804c12273ef3207",
      "mergedPostDetails": "VRChat party system where you can party up with friends to make world hopping easier.\n\nParty leader will hop to a world and if you wish to follow a notification will pop up allowing you to click join or decline.\n\nIf joining a qued instance it would put everyone in your party into the que at the same time. That way it's all synced up and your group is more organized when joining events together. \n\n( Instead of having 1 person who is 5th in que and one person who is 40th in que because they didn't know to que up because miscommunication )\n\nI would love something like this tbh, I feel like every weekend when hopping around with friends there is always 1 or 2 people who didn't hear we're hopping and then they didn't que up for an instance and then they often don't make it in :(",
